quest title=The Seven Bridges
quest intro=A great fen with a lost town in its middle, cut off behind seven raised drawbridges. The fen-warden's map is in his hut at the landing.
# Chapter 1 - the warden's hut
step reach|fenlanding|1|Land at the fen landing
step read|The fen-warden's map|1|Read the fen-warden's map in his hut
step open|Warden's chest|1|Open the warden's chest
# Chapter 2 - Reedcut
step reach|reedcut|1|Pole north to Reedcut
step read|Reedcut's elder|1|Read the elder's request on the meeting post
step catch|Chicken|3|Net Reedcut's three runaway geese
step reach|bridge1|1|Turn Reedcut's windlass and cross the Reed Bridge
# Chapter 3 - Eelmarsh
step reach|eelmarsh|1|Go on to Eelmarsh
step read|Eelmarsh's elder|1|Read the elder's request
step collect|story:bridgepin|1|Dive to the old eel trap for the bridge pin (air under the sunk punt)
step reach|bridge2|1|Put the pin in the windlass and cross the Eel Bridge
# Chapter 4 - Mothwick
step reach|mothwick|1|Go on to Mothwick
step read|The wisp rhyme|1|Read the wisp rhyme
step reach|wisp|1|Blow the three horns in the rhyme's order and stand in the wisp's light
step reach|bridge3|1|Cross the Wisp Bridge
# Chapter 5 - Turfholm
step reach|turfholm|1|Go on to Turfholm
step read|Turfholm's elder|1|Read the elder's request
step kill|Warthog|4|Drive the bog boars out of the cutting
step reach|bridge4|1|Cross the Turf Bridge
# Chapter 6 - Heronsby
step reach|heronsby|1|Go on to Heronsby
step read|The healer's request|1|Read the healer's request
step collect|story:fenmint|1|Fetch fen-mint from the hermit's isle
step reach|bridge5|1|Give the healer the mint and cross the Heron Bridge
# Chapter 7 - Willowbend
step reach|willowbend|1|Go on to Willowbend
step read|The lock-keeper's note|1|Read the lock-keeper's note
step reach|millisle|1|Get through the lock to the mill isle before the gate shuts
step reach|bridge6|1|Turn the miller's windlass and cross the Mill Bridge
# Chapter 8 - Stillwater
step reach|stillwater|1|Go on to silent Stillwater
step read|The last villager's warning|1|Read the last villager's warning
step kill|Mama bear|1|Face the Bog Beast on the causeway
step reach|bridge7|1|Cross the Still Bridge
# Chapter 9 - Sevenbridge
step read|The Sevenbridge charter|1|Read the charter on the town hall's door
step kill|Rat|4|Clear the rats out of the hall's cellar
step collect|story:townseal|1|Ring the town bell for the seven bridges
step open|Sevenbridge's hoard|1|Open the town's hoard
quest done=Seven bridges down, the bell rung, and Sevenbridge joined to the fen again. The villages will come over the causeways tomorrow - to a town somebody saved.
quest reward=Cooked_Herring*4;Rope*6;Plank*8

save The Great Fen
